      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766890939323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因为它是一个离散的输入模型",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因为它是一个离散的输入模型",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LfXs4SHDLflXB0RIKUMjK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 396.31312356217865,
      "y": -3038.75265805109,
      "width": 917.447811596589,
      "height": 73.9877267416604,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 154540569,
      "version": 230,
      "versionNonce": 1301609559,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766890939323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "那也就是说每次的输入需要记下来\n这就是所谓的记忆，这样我就知道了前面已经有几次这样的情况出现了",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "那也就是说每次的输入需要记下来\n这就是所谓的记忆，这样我就知道了前面已经有几次这样的情况出现了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bP6PNch_Yu3MsBSrlqqVB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 391.2396407354431,
      "y": -2936.6145779373637,
      "width": 651.0919953266115,
      "height": 36.9938633708302,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2138926841,
      "version": 373,
      "versionNonce": 1065932953,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766890939323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当我记忆满足一定的情况，我就要改变我的输出了",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当我记忆满足一定的情况，我就要改变我的输出了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mv37U_xvB-M6jxTcx8LFt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 395.0447109225792,
      "y": -2873.7602080512856,
      "width": 295.9509069666416,
      "height": 36.9938633708302,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1606887385,
      "version": 395,
      "versionNonce": 2088851831,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766890939323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "就好像人类的记忆一样",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "就好像人类的记忆一样",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
